      "rationale": "P002 supplies the property definition, workload qualification and distinction from median duration."
    }
  },
  "signal_basis": {
    "component_id": "C001_SIGNAL",
    "value": "Observe each revision's export count, fraction exceeding one hour and uncertainty, recording workload and load. Classify against prespecified acceptable and elevated ranges using comparable end-to-end timing; trials stopped before one hour have unknown threshold outcomes.",
    "scope": "Measurement and classification of the defined tail-rate property across revisions under comparable workloads.",
